0 0x0001 0 0 0 X X X X X
C 0x0001 0 0 0 X X X X X
0 0 0 0 0 0x0000 X X X X
C 0 0 0 0 X X X X X
# jumped into the subroutine
0 0 0 0 0 0x0003 X X X X
C 0 0 0 0 X X X X X
C 0 0 0 0 X X X X X
# and came back to the instruction after JAL
0 0 0 0 0 0x0001 X X X X
C 0 0 0 0 X X X X X
# R7 holds PC+1 of the JAL, zero extended into 16 bits
0 0 0x0001 0x0007 0 X X X 0x0001 X
0 0 0x0001 0x0004 0 X X X 0x0008 X
0 0 0x0001 0x0002 0 X X X 0x0005 X
</dataString>
